spice
* SPICE Netlist for the given schematic

VDD 7 0 DC <value> * Replace <value> with actual voltage
Vi 2 0 DC <value> * Replace <value> with actual input voltage

R1 5 2 <value> * Replace <value> with resistance of R1
R2 5 8 <value> * Replace <value> with resistance of R2
